</point>

<point name="info_ai_respawn" color="0 0.25 1" box="-18 -18 -24 18 18 48">
GT_COOP_SURVIVAL AI wave respawn point. AI of a matching team spawn here between waves.
START_OFF	spawns disabled; an AIScript "alertentity" call toggles it on/off
BIG			reserved for large AI (protosoldier, supersoldier, helga, heinrich); normal AI ignore BIG spots, big AI only use BIG spots
"aiteam"	team id this spot serves (strict match against the AI's team; default 0)
"ainame"	restrict this spot to the single AI with this script name
"target"	info_notnull to face when spawning
"nobots"	set to 1 to forbid bots
"nohumans"	set to 1 to forbid non-bots
<flag key="START_OFF" name="START_OFF" bit="0"/>
<flag key="BIG" name="BIG" bit="1"/>
</point>

